{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pepper Odyssey</strong> is an RPG about surviving a shipwreck in an unruly outlandish island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pepper merchant is shipwrecked in a remote island. Remote, but far from desert. In fact, the island is filled with various factions controlling their territories, some content in going about their business, others scheming great destinies for the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the lawless island: fight, trade and explore. Gather scrap to trade, improve your shelter and build yourself the\u00a0means to escape; or meddle in the affairs of the island and realize a vision for its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Enter a Quirky and Unexpectable World. Encounter anything from a sad pile of leaves to a giant copy machine made of stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Awesome Pixel Art; explore every nook and cranny of a colourful tropical island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Try Your Luck; each area of the island includes a set of randomized events and battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Turn Based Battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Peace or War; use physical force or influence the emotions of your enemies through literature to resolve matters peacefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-An OST of Surreal Exotica</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Your Mind Ablaze</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622840?t=1763710797","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622840?t=1763710797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622840/857fbe173ce532ae228e6bedb01577816a2bd2cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763710797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622840/857fbe173ce532ae228e6bedb01577816a2bd2cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763710797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3622880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pepper Odyssey</strong> is an RPG about surviving a shipwreck in an unruly outlandish island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pepper merchant is shipwrecked in a remote island. Remote, but far from desert. In fact, the island is filled with various factions controlling their territories, some content in going about their business, others scheming great destinies for the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the lawless island: fight, trade and explore. Gather scrap to trade, improve your shelter and build yourself the\u00a0means to escape; or meddle in the affairs of the island and realize a vision for its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Enter a Quirky and Unexpectable World. Encounter anything from a sad pile of leaves to a giant copy machine made of stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Awesome Pixel Art; explore every nook and cranny of a colourful tropical island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Try Your Luck; each area of the island includes a set of randomized events and battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Turn Based Battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Peace or War; use physical force or influence the emotions of your enemies through literature to resolve matters peacefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-An OST of Surreal Exotica</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Your Mind Ablaze</p>","developers":["Wavey Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622840/3a0468047c1f1edd2351c31e522c17bb1d4d4087/header.jpg?t=1763710797","is_free"